[00:21.58]O Jehovah, Sov’reign Ruler,
[00:27.72]You are the one I love and obey.
[00:33.98]You deserve my full devotion;
[00:40.18]You are my God; I’ll serve you each day.
[00:46.74]Your commands I loyally follow;
[00:53.00]How I love reminders from you!
[00:58.85](Chorus)
[00:59.00]O Jehovah, you are worthy;
[01:05.67]Whole-souled devotion I give to you.
[01:25.88]Father, all your works exalt you.
[01:30.92]Earth, moon, and stars your glory proclaim.
[01:37.46]May I also be as faithful,
[01:43.72]Using my strength to make known your name.
[01:50.06]May I use my whole life to serve you,
[01:56.44]Proving to be loyal and true.
[02:02.43](Chorus)
[02:02.58]O Jehovah, you are worthy;
[02:09.26]Whole-souled devotion I give to you.
